/E (Approximately 150 poor and needy families received freshly prepared hot meals through the humanitarian food distribution program in Sadiqabad, District Rahim Yar Khan, helping reduce food insecurity and provide immediate relief. Approximately 350 individuals, including women, children, elderly persons, and low income workers, benefited from nutritious hot meals distributed with dignity and compassion.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
