2167 0 obj
<<
/Title (The cooked meal distribution initiative was successfully implemented in Sadiqabad, District Rahim Yar Khan, with the aim of providing immediate food assistance to poor, needy, and vulnerable families facing food insecurity and financial difficulties. Through this humanitarian effort, 150 families representing approximately 350 individuals received freshly prepared cooked meals. The initiative focused on ensuring that deserving families had access to nutritious food support while maintaining dignity and respect throughout the distribution process. The initiative was carried out with the dedication and support of volunteers who contributed their time and efforts toward coordination and distribution activities. Their commitment ensured that meals were delivered efficiently and reached families most in need. The program provided essential relief to vulnerable households and helped address short-term food challenges by delivering timely assistance to individuals and families experiencing hardship.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2110 0 R
/Prev 2166 0 R
>>
endobj
